Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.2.38-rt56 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.2.38 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  Head SHA1: a9e3058ae7d34cedb5f15c81d180b5c3a6604c7c


Or to build 3.2.38-rt56 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.2.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.2.38.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.2/patch-3.2.38-rt56.patch.xz



Enjoy,

-- Steve



